<title>CHINA: TRADING IN CHINA FOODS SHARES SUSPENDED.</title>
<headline>TRADING IN CHINA FOODS SHARES SUSPENDED.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of China Foods Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Shares of the food processing concern gained HK$0.05 to end at HK$4.75 each on Tuesday.</p>
<p>China Foods is controlled by China National Cereals Oil and Foodstuffs Import and Export Corp (Ceroil).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
